Subject: [PATCH] odhcp6c: sync public upstream runtime safety fixes

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/odhcp6c/commit/10a52220aec9d45803518d8cc4d63e552484ed61

Bring the pinned source runtime code to this upstream snapshot while
retaining the existing package configuration and installation interface.
The update includes the parser and memory-safety fixes backported by the
24.10 branch, adapted upstream to the newer source layout used here.

